  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p>The basic Blaster Rifle is standard issue to soldiers across the galaxy. Some Blaster Rifles, such as the BlasTech E-11 (or its \"Clone,\" the SoroSuub Stormtrooper One), have a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Retractable_Stock\" title=\"Retractable Stock\">Retractable Stock</a>. A Blaster Rifle without a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Retractable_Stock\" title=\"Retractable Stock\">Retractable Stock</a> costs 900 credits (instead of 1,000 credits). </p><p>A Blaster Rifle requires a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a> to operate. After 50 shots, the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a> must be replaced. </p>",
